hse=head('HSE Policy','Logic Plus Electrical Contracting LLC HSE policy principles covering health, safety, environmental responsibility, risk awareness and continuous improvement.')+nav('hse')+hero('HEALTH · SAFETY · ENVIRONMENT','HSE Policy','Responsible electrical work starts with protecting people, controlling risks and maintaining a strong safety culture.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="eyebrow">Our Commitment</span><h2>Safety is integral to professional electrical delivery.</h2><p>Logic Plus recognizes the importance of protecting employees, clients, visitors, project stakeholders and the environment throughout our activities.</p><p>Our HSE approach emphasizes hazard awareness, competent supervision, safe electrical work practices, appropriate training, emergency preparedness, responsible environmental practices and continual improvement.</p><ul class="professional-check"><li>Identify hazards and control workplace risks.</li><li>Promote safe electrical work and site practices.</li><li>Provide appropriate training and safety awareness.</li><li>Maintain competent supervision and responsible work planning.</li><li>Reduce waste and avoid unnecessary environmental impact.</li><li>Review performance and improve practices over time.</li></ul></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="hse-visual"><div class="hse-shield"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div><span>HSE</span><strong>People. Safety. Responsibility.</strong><p>A disciplined approach to safer and more responsible project execution.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section section-light"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><span class="eyebrow">Core Principles</span><h2>Four pillars of our HSE approach</h2></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="hse-card"><div class="hse-number">01</div><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i><h4>Protect People</h4><p>Prioritize the health and safety of everyone affected by our work.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="hse-card"><div class="hse-number">02</div><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle"></i><h4>Control Risk</h4><p>Recognize hazards and apply appropriate controls before work proceeds.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="hse-card"><div class="hse-number">03</div><i class="bi bi-tree"></i><h4>Respect Environment</h4><p>Use responsible practices to reduce waste, pollution and unnecessary impact.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="hse-card"><div class="hse-number">04</div><i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right-circle"></i><h4>Improve Continuously</h4><p>Learn from experience and strengthen HSE performance over time.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section dark-section"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><span class="eyebrow">Safe Work Culture</span><h2>Good planning is part of good safety.</h2><p>Clear scope, competent people, appropriate controls and effective communication help create safer working environments.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg w-100" href="contact.html">Discuss a Project</a></div></div></div></section>'''+modal()+footer()+page_end()
